Type: Package
Package: CLWBM
Title: Cold Lake Water Balance Model 
Version: 0.8
Date: 2026-09-07
Authors@R: c(person("Kevin", "Shook", 
              email = "kshook@kshook.ca", 
              role = c("cre", "aut"))
             )                
Author: Kevin Shook [cre, aut],
Maintainer: Kevin Shook <kshook@kshook.ca>
Description: Models water balance of Cold Lake to simulate changes in the lake level caused by
modelled climate change scenarios. The model requires forcings (inputs) from CRHM models of
the Cold Lake and Primrose Lake basins.
